WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:06.270
A common point of criticism when it comes
to One Piece is the lack of strong and interesting

00:00:06.270 --> 00:00:10.680
female characters. And there certainly is
something to this argument, especially when

00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:16.090
looking at recent arcs. Nonetheless One Piece
also celebrates diversity as much as no other

00:00:16.090 --> 00:00:21.180
anime does. It is not very surprising then,
that the story is home to one of the most

00:00:21.180 --> 00:00:25.539
amazing female characters out there. And that
in an industry that often seems to suffer

00:00:25.539 --> 00:00:31.970
from a bad case of same-face syndrome. Nami
is anything but just another shy manga girl.

00:00:31.970 --> 00:00:36.429
Right from the beginning, we got to know her
as the clever and lively person that she is.

00:00:36.429 --> 00:00:41.570
In more than just one way, she is an incredibly
exciting character. Despite appearing weak

00:00:41.570 --> 00:00:47.820
compared to someone like Zoro, we knew right
away that Nami is badass in her very own way.

00:00:47.820 --> 00:00:52.019
She has an incredibly strong will, especially
for a young girl that had to live through

00:00:52.019 --> 00:00:56.809
truly tough times as a child. Despite seeing
her foster mother being killed in front of

00:00:56.809 --> 00:01:01.389
her eyes, she decided to protect her village
by working for Bellemere´s murderer Arlong

00:01:01.389 --> 00:01:06.680
instead. And over the course of the story
she keeps reminding us of just how strong

00:01:06.680 --> 00:01:12.310
her will is over and over again. To get a
grasp of this, we look at the tea party, where

00:01:12.310 --> 00:01:16.729
she was even able to withstand Big Mom´s
conqueror’s Haki outburst. Closely connected

00:01:16.729 --> 00:01:22.189
to this is Nami´s bravery. Even though she
is often seen as a coward together with Usopp

00:01:22.189 --> 00:01:27.410
and Chopper, she actually has more than once
proven her will to fight when necessary. Most

00:01:27.410 --> 00:01:32.369
prominently, we see this in her fight against
Ms. Doublefinger, where she stands her ground,

00:01:32.369 --> 00:01:36.770
even while being seriously wounded. So, I
would argue that in her own way she is the

00:01:36.770 --> 00:01:41.219
exact opposite of a coward, especially when
you consider that she lacks the monstrous

00:01:41.219 --> 00:01:46.140
fighting strength of a Luffy, a Zoro or a
Sanji. But as we all know, there is a lot

00:01:46.140 --> 00:01:51.439
more to Nami than just her strong will: Nami
is smart. She is the type of character that

00:01:51.439 --> 00:01:56.729
has the wits that you always look for in an
anime. Next to Robin she is arguably the smartest

00:01:56.729 --> 00:02:00.990
member of the straw hats and was even revealed
by Oda to be the 3rd smartest person from

00:02:00.990 --> 00:02:06.280
the entire east blue. What is truly fascinating
though is how broad her understanding of the

00:02:06.280 --> 00:02:11.890
world is. As we all know Nami is the navigator
of the crew and therefore has excellent knowledge

00:02:11.890 --> 00:02:16.950
of the weather, the sea, navigation itself.
And she is even an excellent cartographer

00:02:16.950 --> 00:02:19.810
with the goal to map the entire world. Being
in charge of the ship, she often can be seen

00:02:19.810 --> 00:02:25.330
giving orders to the crew to lift the mast
or to draw in the sails. Nami also is really

00:02:25.330 --> 00:02:29.890
smart with money. Having dedicated much of
her life to collecting riches in order to

00:02:29.890 --> 00:02:34.770
free her village from Arlong, she has developed
an obsession with money and treasure. This

00:02:34.770 --> 00:02:39.140
makes her pretty much the only straw hat that
actually cares about the crew´s spending’s,

00:02:39.140 --> 00:02:42.550
which is also why she acts as the matter of
fact treasurer on the ship.

00:02:42.550 --> 00:02:47.480
The only thing that Nami seems to value even
more than a big pile of gold, are the people

00:02:47.480 --> 00:02:52.750
around her. She is one of the most compassionate
and emotional members on the crew. This means

00:02:52.750 --> 00:02:57.950
in no way that she is overly sensitive or
emotional. On the contrary, we know how tough

00:02:57.950 --> 00:03:03.470
and confident Nami usually is. What this actually
means is, that she cares deeply for others

00:03:03.470 --> 00:03:08.440
and wants to help those who are in need. Nami
is able to show us a broad range of emotions

00:03:08.440 --> 00:03:13.110
in the face of all the events that take place
around the straw hats. This allows her to

00:03:13.110 --> 00:03:17.900
easily make new friends wherever she goes.
Looking at it from a different perspective,

00:03:17.900 --> 00:03:22.940
it is easy to recognize that this goes hand
in hand with understanding people. In other

00:03:22.940 --> 00:03:28.920
words: Nami also is socially smart. Understanding
people and their motives allow you to also

00:03:28.920 --> 00:03:33.980
understand different situations and how to
act in them. This is, what often makes Nami

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:38.810
the voice of reason in the crew. If she deems
an island to be dangerous, she will often

00:03:38.810 --> 00:03:43.500
try to convince Luffy to not go there. Nonetheless,
she will respect and follow Luffy's orders

00:03:43.500 --> 00:03:47.500
when he demands so.
As you can see, Nami is a tremendously interesting

00:03:47.500 --> 00:03:51.720
character that not only has a very strong
will, but that also has a brilliant mind.

00:03:51.720 --> 00:03:57.751
I would argue that it is this combination,
that makes her such a great manipulator. Manipulation

00:03:57.751 --> 00:04:03.140
describes the act of influencing someone or
something in order to achieve a certain goal,

00:04:03.140 --> 00:04:07.920
often out of self-interest. In a different
context, in can also mean actively taking

00:04:07.920 --> 00:04:13.160
control of someone or something. In other
words, a manipulator is a person who controls

00:04:13.160 --> 00:04:18.750
or influences others in a clever and sometimes
unfair way. So, let´s take a look at what

00:04:18.750 --> 00:04:24.840
makes Nami such a master manipulator and why
this makes her so important for the crew.Being

00:04:24.840 --> 00:04:29.930
the clever and confident woman, she is, Nami
is able to manipulate on more than just one

00:04:29.930 --> 00:04:34.980
level. Having grown up as the infamous “cat
burglar” the skills to get what she wants

00:04:34.980 --> 00:04:41.560
is a central part of her character. In essence,
Nami manipulates in three different ways.

00:04:41.560 --> 00:04:46.310
The first thing that Nami manipulates on a
regular basis is the weather. She is able

00:04:46.310 --> 00:04:51.310
to do that by using her so-called Clima-Tact
to manipulate the weather in her surroundings.

00:04:51.310 --> 00:04:55.650
When combined with her immense knowledge of
meteorology and weather systems, this staff

00:04:55.650 --> 00:05:01.350
can achieve some truly devastating results.
Originally created by Usopp, the Clima-Tact

00:05:01.350 --> 00:05:05.880
has been upgraded frequently over the course
of the story. The newest version contains

00:05:05.880 --> 00:05:10.580
almost all the science of the sky island Weatheria,
where Nami spent the 2 years during the time

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:15.389
skip studying. Recently, with the addition
of Big Mom´s personal homie Zeus after the

00:05:15.389 --> 00:05:21.120
events in Whole Cake Island, the staff got
another major upgrade. As a result, Nami is

00:05:21.120 --> 00:05:26.340
now able to create different weather phenomena,
including wind and lightning. This manipulation

00:05:26.340 --> 00:05:31.720
of the weather allows her to fight alongside
her Nakama and further improve her capabilities

00:05:31.720 --> 00:05:35.320
as a navigator.
The second target of Nami´s manipulations

00:05:35.320 --> 00:05:39.970
are her enemies. Since her fighting style
is focused around her climate-tact, she uses

00:05:39.970 --> 00:05:44.790
it to manipulate her enemies with it as well.
The perfect example of this is her mirage

00:05:44.790 --> 00:05:49.890
tempo, that creates illusions for her opponents
in order to trick and irritate them. The effectiveness

00:05:49.890 --> 00:05:54.340
of this can for instance be seen in her fight
against Kalifa of CP9.

00:05:54.340 --> 00:05:58.690
But Nami wouldn´t be Nami, if she couldn´t
manipulate her enemies on a psychological

00:05:58.690 --> 00:06:03.370
level as well. After all she tried to manipulate
Arlong for most of her life, by pretending

00:06:03.370 --> 00:06:11.020
to be on his side. Using her wits and her
great understanding of people and situations,

00:06:11.020 --> 00:06:15.161
she can easily manipulate her opponents. We
see this playing out for the first time, when

00:06:15.161 --> 00:06:19.360
she lures a few members of the buggy pirates
onto her small boat by showing them a fake

00:06:19.360 --> 00:06:24.590
treasure. She then sneaks on board of their
ship and sails away with it. But Nami outdid

00:06:24.590 --> 00:06:30.020
herself especially in the Whole Cake Island
arc. At first, she realizes the power of Big

00:06:30.020 --> 00:06:34.690
Mom´s Vivre Card and uses it to force King
Baum and the Homies of the forest to obey

00:06:34.690 --> 00:06:39.750
her. Later she goes on to manipulates King
Baum into helping her and Luffy escape to

00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:44.770
the ship and later also tricks the homie cannon
balls sent after the Sunny. Most importantly

00:06:44.770 --> 00:06:49.320
of course though she manipulated Zeus into
hitting Big Mom herself with lightning twice

00:06:49.320 --> 00:06:54.041
and later EVEN into becoming her servant.
These and many other examples show, HOW great

00:06:54.041 --> 00:06:58.940
Nami is at taking advantage of her cleverness
and skills in order to take down her enemies.

00:06:58.940 --> 00:07:04.330
Finally, an unexpected third group affected
by Nami´s manipulations, are the allies around

00:07:04.330 --> 00:07:08.630
her. Back in the East Blue for instance she
tricked the crew in order to steal the Going

00:07:08.630 --> 00:07:13.260
Merry from them. She frequently exploits Sanji’s
feelings towards her and she also knows how

00:07:13.260 --> 00:07:17.070
to influence the other members of the group
to a certain extent, with the exception of

00:07:17.070 --> 00:07:21.780
Robin maybe. The most amusing example of this
type of manipulation though is most likely

00:07:21.780 --> 00:07:26.199
after her arrival on the sky island Weatheria
during the time skip. After stealing some

00:07:26.199 --> 00:07:30.310
of their research and trying to escape the
island she was confronted by the inhabitants

00:07:30.310 --> 00:07:35.120
of the island. Yet, Nami easily manipulates
the residents of Weatheria into forgiving

00:07:35.120 --> 00:07:39.860
her earlier escape attempt and theft. She
later even convinces them to give her a house

00:07:39.860 --> 00:07:44.850
among other things so she could stay on the
island to train for two full years. Additionally,

00:07:44.850 --> 00:07:49.130
she also manages to convince one of the inhabitants
to teach her more about the Weather Balls

00:07:49.130 --> 00:07:53.220
and the changing climates and weather patterns
of the New World, despite the fact that she

00:07:53.220 --> 00:07:56.260
had previously taken him hostage in order
to escape.

00:07:56.260 --> 00:08:02.030
What all of these examples show, is how amazingly
Nami is able to use the power of manipulation

00:08:02.030 --> 00:08:07.380
to not only influence friends and foes alike,
but even the weather itself. So now that we

00:08:07.380 --> 00:08:12.840
know how skilled Nami actually is, how does
this manipulation benefit her and the crew?

00:08:12.840 --> 00:08:16.600
Well first of all, I think we can all agree
that being able to manipulate the weather

00:08:16.600 --> 00:08:21.720
is a pretty useful skill to have for any pirate
crew. It can be used to bring the navigation

00:08:21.720 --> 00:08:25.830
of the ship to new levels and at the same
time can be used as a surprisingly strong

00:08:25.830 --> 00:08:30.919
weapon in fights. Especially today´s Nami
is anything but useless when it comes to battles

00:08:30.919 --> 00:08:34.569
and conflicts.
And obviously, being able to manipulate and

00:08:34.569 --> 00:08:39.020
outsmart your opponents using your own or
other people´s skills is a crucial advantage

00:08:39.020 --> 00:08:43.599
in many of the dangerous situations that the
straw hats end up in. At the same time Nami

00:08:43.599 --> 00:08:48.829
is able to use her manipulation to turn former
enemies into valuable allies. Great examples

00:08:48.829 --> 00:08:53.680
for this are characters like Zeus on Whole
Cake Island, Vivi on Whiskey Peak or Lola

00:08:53.680 --> 00:08:57.140
back on Thriller Bark.
In other words, through her manipulation Nami

00:08:57.140 --> 00:09:02.199
allows her crew to master critical situations
and at times even profit from them.

00:09:02.199 --> 00:09:06.350
But of course, this Nami analysis wouldn´t
be complete without mentioning a few other

00:09:06.350 --> 00:09:09.410
characteristics of her, that make her so important
for the crew.

00:09:09.410 --> 00:09:14.029
The fact alone, that Nami navigates the Grand
Line for the straw hats would be reason enough

00:09:14.029 --> 00:09:18.670
already. Without her, Luffy and the others
would most likely never have made it so far.

00:09:18.670 --> 00:09:22.639
But Nami is also one of the most important
members when it comes to creating the crew’s

00:09:22.639 --> 00:09:28.209
dynamic that we love so much. Like every other
straw hat, Nami has a special and close relationship

00:09:28.209 --> 00:09:32.869
with her captain. But, unlike many of the
others, she has a very unique and individual

00:09:32.869 --> 00:09:37.110
relationship with every other crew member
on the ship. No matter if it´s her mood swings

00:09:37.110 --> 00:09:42.129
regarding Sanji or her adoration of Chopper.
Seeing her interact with everyone on the ship

00:09:42.129 --> 00:09:47.360
feels incredibly natural. You could even say,
that she takes the role of a big sister in

00:09:47.360 --> 00:09:51.939
the crew that keeps everyone in check. That
also includes standing up and fighting for

00:09:51.939 --> 00:09:57.240
her Nakama when she has to. And it also means
not letting any of the crew members just disappear

00:09:57.240 --> 00:10:01.459
but fighting for them to stay.
All in all, I can´t help but say that Nami

00:10:01.459 --> 00:10:06.559
is an amazing character, that could be a role
model for girls, if it weren´t for the unnecessary

00:10:06.559 --> 00:10:11.480
degree of fanservice, especially in the anime,
that her character has to go through. Because

00:10:11.480 --> 00:10:16.420
Nami is an important character for any reader.
While all straw hats have their relatable

00:10:16.420 --> 00:10:21.709
moments, Nami is exceptionally so. Her broad
range of emotions, her cleverness as well

00:10:21.709 --> 00:10:25.579
as her growth as a character give the reader
the feeling that they might make it in the

00:10:25.579 --> 00:10:29.510
world of One Piece as well. And while I hope
that we will get more strong and interesting

00:10:29.510 --> 00:10:34.779
female characters in the future of the story,
I am sure that Nami will keep being amazing.

00:10:34.779 --> 00:10:39.089
But now let me hear your thoughts on this.
What do you like or dislike about Nami? Do

00:10:39.089 --> 00:10:42.850
you think there is too much fan service for
her character? And what does the future hold

00:10:42.850 --> 00:10:47.800
for her? If you liked this video, don´t forget
to like share and subscribe to be notified

00:10:47.800 --> 00:10:52.441
for any future content of mine. Or dislike,
don´t share and unsubscribe, it´s a free

00:10:52.441 --> 00:10:58.290
world people.
I hope to see you around next time and until

00:10:58.290 --> 00:10:58.569
then, have a great week.

